# The Tauri shell stages the prepared runtime and seed beside its crate so `tauri build`
# can read them, and `tauri build` writes its own cargo target tree there. Both are build
# outputs of the shared payload pipeline: the runtime and seed are staged from
# `apps/desktop/.desktop-build`, the icon is copied from `apps/desktop/build`, and the
# sidecar bundle is produced by esbuild. None of them is a source file.
apps/desktop-shell/src-tauri/resources/
apps/desktop-shell/src-tauri/icons/
apps/desktop-shell/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop-shell/src-tauri/gen/
